# The crops of Lobart's field by time (reports/content/2026-11-19-crop-fields, plan step 5): four held views of
# crop-pilot.bench at noon, over the strips of rye, stubble and plough of a set built by
# scripts/content/crop_field_set.py. Compare the set with the content it was copied from:
#   PERF_ENV='OPENGOTHIC_GPU_PASSES=1' scripts/perf-content.sh <content today> <crop set> crops
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode walk
watch player
goto NW_FARM1_FIELD_01
# view 1: from the field's edge, the eye's height: both plots across the frame
cam at 11397 1535 -15229 10990 1274 -12919
clear 3000
wait 20000
perf sample perf-crops/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
shot view-1
wait 300
# view 2: from 15 m over the field: every row is drawn
cam at 6690 2151 -12919 10990 1274 -12919
wait 8000
perf sample perf-crops/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
shot view-2
wait 300
# view 3: inside the rye, the eye's height: the cards fill the frame, the worst for overdraw
cam at 10271 1439 -13394 11431 1463 -14344
wait 8000
perf sample perf-crops/view-3
wait 8000
perf stop
shot view-3
wait 300
# view 4: the strip's edge: tufts of single stalks before the wall of rye
cam at 9754 1413 -13552 10682 1455 -14312
wait 8000
perf sample perf-crops/view-4
wait 8000
perf stop
shot view-4
wait 300
